@TaskLane.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Register (anonymous)
POST {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery"
}

### Sign in with the demo account (Development) and copy accessToken into @token
POST {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@tasklane.dev",
  "password": "TaskLane-Demo-2026"
}

###
@token = paste-the-access-token-here

### Current user profile (requires the token)
GET {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks: active list (search, status, dueFrom/dueTo, sort, direction, page, pageSize)
GET {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?search=demo&sort=dueDate&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks: due-date range (at most Tasks:DueDateRangeMaxDays days, 90 by default)
GET {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?dueFrom=2026-12-01&dueTo=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks: settings the screens need
GET {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks: create (only the title is required) and copy the id into @taskId
POST {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare demo",
  "description": "Slides and seed data",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}

###
@taskId = paste-the-task-id-here

### Tasks: one task (active or deleted)
GET {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks: replace the editable values (null description or dueDate clears it)
PUT {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare demo",
  "description": null,
  "status": "Done",
  "dueDate": null
}

### Tasks: delete (soft, idempotent)
DELETE {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks: deleted list (same parameters; extra sort deletedAt, the default)
GET {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/deleted
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks: restore (idempotent)
POST {{TaskLane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
